---
source: tests/tui_render.rs
expression: terminal.backend().to_string()
---
"┌ Favor┌Keys──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐──────┐"
"│* adds│Tab / Shift-Tab          Next pane / previous pane                        │om>   │"
"└──────│Enter                    Open the folder or message, fold a date group    │ne    │"
"┌ Unrea│→ ←  l h                 Unfold/fold folder or group; → ← next/prev mail  │      │"
"│No unr│*                        Add the folder to Favorites or take it out       │      │"
"└──────│↑ ↓  j k                 Move, or scroll the message                      │      │"
"┏ Folde│PgUp PgDn Ctrl-B Ctrl-F  Move or scroll a page                            │      │"
"┃>   In│Ctrl-U Ctrl-D            Move or scroll half a page                       │      │"
"┃    Se│g g  G  Home End         Jump to the first or last                        │      │"
"┃    Pr│h j k l w b e 0 $        Move the cursor in the message, as Vim does      │      │"
"┃      │v V then y, or yy        Pick text or lines from the cursor, copy them    │      │"
"┃      │z  b                     Zoom the pane or show all, hide the folders      │      │"
"┃      │Space, Ctrl-A            Mark a message, mark them all (Esc clears)       │      │"
"┃      │d                        Move marked, selected or folder to Deleted Items │      │"
"┃      │D                        Delete marked, selected or folder for good       │      │"
"┃      │m  p  F Insert           Move, pin or flag the marked or selected mail    │      │"
"┃      │a  A  F2                 New subfolder, new top folder, rename folder     │      │"
"┃      │c  r  R  f               Write a message, reply, reply to all, forward    │      │"
"┃      │F5  Ctrl-R               Sync every folder now                            │      │"
"┃      │/                        Search every folder (Esc goes back)              │      │"
"┃      │S  C                     Write this account's signature, show its calendar│      │"
"┃      │?  q  Ctrl-C             Show this help, quit                             │      │"
"┗━━━━━━│                         Press any key to close                           │──────┘"
" ? help└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘q quit "
